    'EXPLAIN shows how the engine will run the query: scan or index, join order, estimated rows. Plain EXPLAIN does not run it; EXPLAIN ANALYZE (PostgreSQL, MySQL 8) does and adds real timings. Big gaps between estimate and actual often point to stale statistics.',
